    28	/// A half-open byte interval whose start never exceeds its end.
    29	///
    30	/// Offsets and lengths are measured in bytes. Empty spans are valid, including
    31	/// at [`usize::MAX`]. Construction does not check any particular string's
    32	/// length or UTF-8 boundaries; [`Self::slice`] performs those checks.
